msgstr "5个方块或以上的拼块每个方块+10筹码。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:93
msgid "A 19-piece bag of big, plump shapes: squares, Ts, pluses, a Bar 5 and a 3x3. Only 13 placements."
msgstr "19个又大又胖的形状:正方形、T形、十字、长条5和3x3。只有13次放置。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:93
