msgstr "葫芦"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:96
msgid "Form 25 Tray Hands across runs."
msgstr "累计组成25个托盘牌型(跨对局)。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:96
msgid "Only four-block pieces: 20 of them, so Twins and Triplets come often."
msgstr "只有四格拼块:共20个,所以常出双胞胎和三胞胎。"

