msgstr "彩绘玻璃"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:26
msgid "CRYSTAL"
msgstr "水晶"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:26
msgid "Step-cut gems with twinkling facets."
msgstr "阶梯切割、刻面闪烁的宝石。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:28
msgid "Buzzing glass tubes on a black sign."
msgstr "黑色招牌上嗡嗡作响的玻璃灯管。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:28
msgid "NEON"
msgstr "霓虹"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:30
msgid "GOLD"
msgstr "黄金"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:30
msgid "Gilded bullion, enamel jewel, rolling shine."
msgstr "镀金金条、珐琅宝石、流动的光泽。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:32
msgid "MARBLE"
msgstr "大理石"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:32
msgid "Polished stone veined with color."
msgstr "带彩色纹理的抛光石材。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:34
msgid "CYBERPUNK"
msgstr "赛博朋克"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:34
msgid "Circuit boards pulsing with data."
msgstr "跳动着数据的电路板。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:36
msgid "Painted maple blocks with carved rings."
msgstr "刻有年轮的彩绘枫木积木。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:36
msgid "TOY WOOD"
msgstr "玩具木块"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:38
msgid "CANDY"
msgstr "糖果"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:38
msgid "Glossy pinwheels that slowly turn."
msgstr "慢慢旋转的光亮风车糖。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:40
msgid "Basalt plates over pulsing magma."
msgstr "跳动岩浆上的玄武岩板。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:40
msgid "LAVA"
msgstr "熔岩"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:42
msgid "Frosted cubes with trapped bubbles."
msgstr "困着气泡的磨砂冰块。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:42
msgid "ICE"
msgstr "冰块"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:44
msgid "CHROME"
msgstr "铬"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:44
msgid "Mirror polish. A glint races across."
msgstr "镜面抛光。一道闪光掠过。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:46
msgid "Holographic foil in every color at once."
msgstr "同时呈现所有颜色的全息箔。"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:46
msgid "PRISM"
msgstr "棱镜"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:48
msgid "AURORA"
msgstr "极光"

#: game/presentation/finishes.gd:48
msgid "Northern lights over tiny mountains."
msgstr "小小山峦上的北极光。"

